  "description": "CR 702.178a, 702.179: at max speed Far Fortune adds 1 to damage its controller's sources deal opponents, Embalmed Ascendant drains on a death, Endrider Catalyzer taps for {R}{R}, Gas Guzzler sacrifices to draw, Gastal Raider is 3/2 with menace, and Endrider Spikespitter exiles its controller's top card each upkeep to be played that turn; below it none does",
